# Web3Forms API Configuration
#
# To set up the contact form:
# 1. Copy this file to .env.local
# 2. Sign up for a free Web3Forms account at https://web3forms.com
# 3. Get your Access Key from the Web3Forms dashboard
# 4. Replace the placeholder below with your actual Access Key
# 5. Configure your email address in the Web3Forms dashboard to receive form submissions
#
# Note: This is a free service with generous limits (250 submissions/month on free tier)

NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_KEY=your_web3forms_access_key_here
